    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `SetHoldingsMultipleTargetsRegressionAlgorithm.py`。`add_equity(SPY/IBM, Minute, leverage=1)`。`on_data`：若组合未投资 → `set_holdings([PortfolioTarget(SPY,0.8), PortfolioTarget(IBM,0.2)])`；否则 → `set_holdings([PortfolioTarget(IBM,0.8), PortfolioTarget(SPY,0.2)])`。注释称多目标按保证金影响排序提交以避免保证金错误。不是等权双票核，也不是单票 `set_holdings(SPY,1)` 骨架核。提出日期未知。Lean SetHoldingsMultipleTargets：空仓SPY80+IBM20 / 已投资翻转为IBM80+SPY20 ≠ 等权双票 / 单票set_holdings(SPY,1)。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
